      "coherent cp angle theta = 0.0 rad\n",
      "  under RC this twirls EXACTLY to  p_IZ = p_ZI = p_ZZ = sin^2(theta/2)/4 = 0.000000\n",
      "  (proxysim.noise.NoiseModel.twirled);  compare p2 = 0.01 depolarizing on CZ\n"
     ]
