     "text": [
      "merged-gate check: 160 distinct gates, max Aer-vs-Operator deviation 0.0225\n",
      "RC: 30 randomizations x 512 shots = 15360 shots per point\n",
      "    approximate TVD shot floor: 0.0056\n",
